flowchart TD
    A([rebuild_vectordb.py]) --> B[Reset collection + init OpenAIService<br/>chat/vision: gpt-5.5 · embed: text-embedding-3-small]
    B --> E[Load PDFs from papers/]
    E --> F{For each PDF}

    F --> G[Extract text + chunk<br/>pdfplumber → ~400-word chunks]
    G --> P

    F --> I{Image descriptions<br/>enabled?}
    I -->|no| P
    I -->|yes| J[Extract images + captions<br/>PyMuPDF: filter, dedupe, pair caption]
    J --> L[Describe each figure<br/>GPT-5.5 vision + caption hint]
    L --> M{Informative?}
    M -->|no logo/banner| SKIP[Skip]
    M -->|yes| N[Figure chunk<br/>content_type: figure]
    N --> P

    P[Collect chunks + metadata] --> Q[Embed all chunks<br/>text-embedding-3-small]
    Q --> R[Store → ChromaDB]
    R --> F
    F -->|done| S([Result: documents, chunks, vectors])

